WEBVTT

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.719
to their childhood,

00:03:00.719 --> 00:03:04.685
and often, the mind 
gravitates in the past

00:03:04.685 --> 00:03:06.073
to a moment of shame,

00:03:06.073 --> 00:03:09.000
some sin committed, 
some act of selfishness,

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.290
an act of omission, of shallowness,

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:14.033
the sin of anger, the sin of self-pity,

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:17.618
trying to be a people-pleaser, 
a lack of courage.

00:03:17.618 --> 00:03:22.313
Adam I is built by 
building on your strengths.

00:03:22.313 --> 00:03:26.409
Adam II is built by fighting 
your weaknesses.

00:03:26.409 --> 00:03:29.267
You go into yourself, 
you find the sin

00:03:29.267 --> 00:03:30.939
which you've committed over
and again through your life,